From 11f911dea2aa96c92c4965245d25538f64374d05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhilash Koka <abhilash.koka1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 05:57:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Guided Story: product hero ads (60-80% product screen time)

- New default promotion level 'Product hero' with a 60/70/80% screen-time
  target; the script writer plans the video as a product ad.
- Shot plan per scene (shot type, camera move, lighting, product angle);
  product-only B-roll scenes and a product-hook opening are allowed.
- Product screen time is measured; one rework pass when it falls short,
  then a warning. Review shows a meter and per-scene shot pickers.
- Up to 5 photos per product (back, side, label close-up, ...), frozen by
  hash; each shot sends the photo of the angle it shows.
- Product-first scene prompts: product as subject, shallow depth of field,
  named camera and lighting; product-only scenes animate the product photo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
